OL,3,AGTA 6 crashes into top end of music    
OL,4,Achart after its record launch          
OL,6,FGo Easy, a new track from Dua Lipa     
OL,7,Fspecially recorded for the game, is the
OL,8,Fhighest new entry at 21.               
